ent batches. If a surrogate\ncould be identi\ufb01ed which matches one or more measures of the combustion performance of JP8,\nmodels for predicting combustion could be more easily developed by doing experiments on the\nsurrogate rather than JP8 directly. The microgravity platform with its reduced buoyant \ufb02ow\nand ability to promote spherical droplet \ufb02ames can assist in developing such blends for this\n6", "metadata": {"source": "FLEX-2 SRD Final.pdf", "page": 12}}